## 2. System Topology

```text
                    +11.1 V (3S LiPo)
                       │          │
                    ┌──┴──┐    ┌──┴──┐
                    │ Q1  │    │ Q2  │
                    │ PNP │    │ PNP │
                    └──┬──┘    └──┬──┘
                       │           │
                    Node A       Node B
                       │           │
                       │   [ LOAD ]│
                       │   (Head)  │
                       │           │
                    ┌──┴──┐    ┌──┴──┐
                    │ Q3  │    │ Q4  │
                    │ NPN │    │ NPN │
                    │Sink │    │Sink │
                    └──┬──┘    └──┬──┘
                       └─────┬─────┘
                             │
                          [ Re ]
                           1 kΩ
                        Current Sense
                             │
                            GND
                             │
                             └──────> GPIO 34 (ADC)
```

The load is connected between **Node A** and **Node B**. By selecting which high-side transistor supplies the load and which low-side transistor regulates the return current, the direction of current through the load can be reversed.

